;; Ported in part from jdk26u (https://github.com/openjdk/jdk26u at baf63fbe42b8758448fee570a9d9bb914272d259),
;; src/java.base/share/classes/java/util/concurrent/{locks/ReentrantLock,locks/ReentrantReadWriteLock,
;; locks/AbstractQueuedSynchronizer,locks/AbstractQueuedLongSynchronizer,locks/AbstractOwnableSynchronizer,
;; Semaphore,ForkJoinTask}.java (their serial forms and serialization hooks), whose notice follows
;; (LICENSE.md, "OpenJDK (jdk26u)"); the classes were written by Doug Lea with assistance from members of
;; JCP JSR-166 Expert Group and released to the public domain, as explained at
;; http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/ (their files' header).
